        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(x) a right or option in respect of such a security, share,unit, contract or policy;",
            "block_bbox": [
                366,
                156,
                952,
                209
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(xi) any similar financial instrument;",
            "block_bbox": [
                361,
                218,
                756,
                243
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(xii) foreign currency; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                358,
                252,
                642,
                276
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) both:",
            "block_bbox": [
                320,
                283,
                421,
                307
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) at the time the relevant investment decision was made, it was likely that the borrowing would not be needed; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                377,
                314,
                1015,
                366
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) the borrowing is not taken, under a determination made,by legislative instrument, by APRA, to be exempt from this paragraph; and \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                372,
                373,
                1012,
                452
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) the period of the borrowing does not exceed 7 days, and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                318,
                459,
                969,
                486
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) if the borrowing were to take place, the total amount borrowed by the trustee would not exceed 10% of the value of the assets of the fund.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                317,
                495,
                1013,
                575
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision as defined by section 193, and Part 21 therefore provides for civil and criminal consequences of contravening, or of being involved in a contravention of, that subsection.\n",
